WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
- You worked with our
friend Snoop recently.

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.060
I love Snoop, another guy that is just

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.700
the nicest human ever and so talented.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.660
So, how did that come about?

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.830
- So, I've known Snoop since, shoot...

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.940
Since before I was doing standup,

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.723
I had been around around him.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.340
We really got to know each
other when I did Snoop Dogg's

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.280
"Bad Girls of Comedy" for Showtime,

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.350
which I think is now
is on Netflix, I think.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.520
But it's been out for what?

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.470
Like 13, maybe 15 years ago I did it.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.030
And we've been friends ever since.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.687
And ever since I'm always like,

00:00:35.687 --> 00:00:37.050
"Snoop, we need to do a song.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.240
Let me get in the music video.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.073
Let's do a song.

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:39.906
Let's do a song."

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.173
So he was like, " Yeah, sis.

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:42.450
Bring something to the table."

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.870
So, I brought one song to the table

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.520
and that's the theme song now
for the "They Ready" series

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.957
on Netflix, the comedy series that I did.

00:00:50.957 --> 00:00:55.380
And now we just did another
song called "Look Like",

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.740
and I can't wait for y'all to hear that.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.700
It's me, Snoop, Lil Wayne.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.069
It's fire.

00:01:01.069 --> 00:01:03.335
(audience applauding)

00:01:03.335 --> 00:01:04.585
- (clapping) I love that.

